🇺🇸🇮🇱NEW VIDEO: Was "Israel" Behind the Nvidia Takeover? The Evidence & Reasons Behind The Claim

On YouTube: https://youtu.be/jP0YI9IYVc8?si=5ZyL0jvtykZunqjn

▪️Claims regarding an "Israeli takeover" are based on social media posts and a single out-of-context quote from Nvidia's CFO regarding "Israeli executives;" 

▪️In reality, Nvidia bought and now controls Israeli-based company Mellanox requiring the CFO to talk to its executives in Israel because of timezones, talks that involve the CFO directing Mellanox which works FOR Nvidia; 

▪️Another article from Israeli-based Ynet is being cited as evidence "3 Israeli candidates" are under "consideration" when the article itself admits it is speculation and that no evidence exists suggesting the Israelis are interested in the job or have been offered it in the first place; 

▪️The US has stated policy of blaming its actions on its proxies including Israel specifically, with this policy implemented by rigged social media algorithms and emotionally manipulating narratives;
